    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFabulously presented 2 bed semi-detached house Located within a mature, settled town centre development. Superb, fitted kitchen with built in hob and oven Double Glazed windows & gas central heating Private cul de sac location to the rear of the development large rear garden with concrete shedPrivate front garden with driveway parking Minutes walk to Balbriggan town centre, beach and Train StationClose to M1 motorway with easy access to Airport and city centre\n\n\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present 82 Tara Court to the market, a fabulously presented two-bedroom semi-detached home ideally positioned within this mature and well-established town centre development. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this attractive property offers bright, comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers or those seeking a home in a convenient and well-connected location.\nThe accommodation includes a superb fitted kitchen with built-in hob and oven, along with two well-proportioned bedrooms and a welcoming living space. The property further benefits from double-glazed windows and gas central heating, ensuring comfort throughout the year.\n\nA particularly appealing feature of this home is its private cul-de-sac position to the rear of the development, providing a peaceful and private setting away from passing traffic. The property enjoys a large rear garden, offering excellent outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining or gardening, and is further complemented by a useful concrete shed. To the front, there is a private garden together with a driveway providing off-street parking.\n\nThe location is a major attraction, with Balbriggan town centre, the beach and Balbriggan Train Station all within minutes' walk. Balbriggan offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities, while the nearby M1 motorway provides easy access to Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre.\n\nCombining a peaceful cul-de-sac setting with generous gardens, private parking and well-presented accommodation, 82 Tara Court presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a lovely home in a mature and highly convenient residential setting. Properties offering this combination of presentation, outdoor space and town centre convenience are sure to attract strong interest. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and prospective purchasers are advised to arrange an appointment at their earliest convenience to fully appreciate all that this wonderful home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith tiled flooring\n\nKitchen - 2.87m x 2.26m\nwith tiled flooring and kitchen with cooker and plumbed for washing machine\n\nLiving Room - 3.2m x 3.98m\nwith wood flooring, double doors to rear garden\n\nBathroom - 1.6m x 1.6m\nwith tiled flooring and shower cubicle, wc and whb\n\nBedroom One - 2.87m x 3.98m\nwith carpet flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom Two - 3.2m x 2.22m\nwith carpet flooring\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Fabulously presented 2 bed semi-detached house </li><li>Located within a mature, settled town centre development. </li><li>Superb, fitted kitchen with built in hob and oven </li><li>Double Glazed windows & gas central heating </li><li>Private cul de sac location to the rear of the development </li><li>large rear garden with concrete shed</li><li>Private front garden with driveway parking </li><li>Minutes walk to Balbriggan town centre, beach and Train Station</li><li>Close to M1 motorway with easy access to Airport and city centre</ul>"
